  <div id="sutta">
  
            <h4 id="thag5.8" class="h1">Thag 5:8  Vakkali</h4>
            <div class="verse">
              <p>Stricken by sharp, wind-like pains,</p>
              <p>you, monk, living in the forest grove</p>
              <p>—harsh, with limited range for alms—</p>
              <p class="v2">what, what will you do?</p>
              <div class="verse-add">
                <p>Suffusing my body</p>
                <p>with abundant rapture &amp; joy,</p>
                <p>&amp; enduring what’s harsh,</p>
                <p class="v2">I’ll stay in the grove.</p>
              </div><!--end verse-add-->
              <div class="verse-add">
                <p>Developing the establishings of mindfulness,</p>
                <p>strengths, faculties,</p>
                <p>the factors for awakening,<span class="fn"><a href="#thag5.8note01">1</a></span><!--end fn cite--></p>
                <p class="v2">I’ll stay in the grove.</p>
              </div><!--end verse-add-->
              <div class="verse-add">
                <p>Reflecting on those who are resolute,</p>
                <p>their persistence aroused,</p>
                <p>constantly firm in their effort,</p>
                <p>united in concord,</p>
                <p class="v2">I’ll stay in the grove.</p>
              </div><!--end verse-add-->
              <div class="verse-add">
                <p>Recollecting the One Self-awakened,</p>
                <p>self-tamed &amp; centered,</p>
                <p>untiring both day &amp; night,</p>
                <p class="v2">I’ll stay</p>
                <p class="v2">in the grove.</p>
              </div><!--end verse-add-->
            </div><!--end verse-->
            <div class="note">
              <p class="notetitle">Note</p><!--end notetitle-->
              <p id="thag5.8note01">1. On the four establishings of mindfulness, see <a href="../../DN/DN22.html">DN 22</a> and <a href="../../SN/SN47_40.html">SN 47:40</a>; on the five strengths, <a href="../../AN/AN5_2.html">AN 5:2</a>; on the five faculties, <a href="../../SN/SN48_10.html">SN 48:10</a>; and on the seven factors for awakening, <a href="../../SN/SN46_51.html">SN 46:51–52</a>.</p>
            </div><!--end notes-->
            <p class="seealso">See also: <a href="../../DN/DN26.html">DN 26</a>; <a href="../../SN/SN11_3.html">SN 11:3</a>; <a href="../../SN/SN46_14.html">SN 46:14</a>; <a href="../../SN/SN52_10.html">SN 52:10</a>; <a href="../StNp/StNp4_16.html">Sn 4:16</a></p><!--end seealso-->
      </div><!--end:sutta-->
